      "content": "The exhaustion you feel is real, and the weight of perceived betrayal is immense. If the world feels like a structure built on lies, then fighting to keep your place in it is a battle you are not meant to win alone. Instead of struggling against the whole system, consider what small piece of *yourself* you can protect right now, something that requires no outside validation. Sometimes, the most radical act is choosing to simply be still, to let the crushing weight momentarily pause.",
